'''Aspect of the Cat''' is an [[aspect]] skill that grants two alternating [[buff]]s, each with their own duration. Cat's Stealth increases the character's [[stealth]], gives a chance to [[Avoidance|avoid]] all damage from hits, and increases [[Critical strike|critical strike chance]]. Cat's Agility increases attack and cast speed. By default, their durations are 4 and 6 seconds respectively. Only one aspect skill can be active at a time.

==Mechanics==
If crafting the Aspect of the Cat on gear that has sockets, or the Aspect skill from {{il|Farrul's Bite}}, the skill can be supported by socketed support gems. For example, {{il|More Duration Support}}, {{il|Less Duration Support}} or {{il|Efficacy Support}} to alter the buff duration of Cat's Stealth and Cat's Agility. Or supported by {{il|Arrogance Support}} to reserve life instead of mana.

The game will track the time remaining for each buff and resume counting upon reactivation (for example, you cannot rapidly toggle the skill, remove/re-equip the gem, or cycle equipment to spend more time in one buff than allotted).

==Acquisition==
Aspect of the Cat is found on {{il|Farrul's Bite}} or [[beastcrafted]] onto gear as a [[Item affix|suffix]] ({{ml|GrantsCatAspectCrafted}}), by using the captured [[Farrul, First of the Plains]] unique beast. {{il|A Familiar Call}} divination card also rewards a Jewellery with that mod. The skill can be further modified by equipping {{il|Farrul's Chase}}, {{il|Farrul's Fur}}, (or {{il|Replica Farrul's Fur}}) and/or {{il|Farrul's Pounce}}. The Level 30 version of the skill is acquired from beastcrafting with the addition of [[The Black Mórrígan]].

The Level 35 version is only acquirable through [[Wildspeaker]]'s {{psl|Flash of Teeth}} in [[Legacy of Phrecia]].

